pproved\",\"read_asset\",\"search_history\",\"read_history\",\"read_skill\",\"save_document\",\"measure_text\",\"generate_image\",\"edit_image\",\"generate_video\",\"read_media_result\"],\"imageObservation\":false,\"videoObservation\":false,\"note\":\"Tools define current capabilities. Methods do not enable media. Follow the mode in each actual tool definition.\"}}"
